# No environment variables are currently required to run this app.
#
# Live COE premiums (src/app/drive/api/coe/route.js) and car prices
# (src/app/drive/api/cars/route.js) both come from public, keyless sources
# — data.gov.sg's mirror of LTA's COE dataset, and the OneMotoring Car Cost
# Update PDF, respectively. Neither needs an API key or account.
